sequenceDiagram
    participant S as vga_sync
    participant B as ball_paddle
    participant F as game_fsm
    participant R as renderer
    Note over S,R: visible area: renderer draws 640x480 pixels from current positions
    S->>B: frame_tick (start of vblank)
    S->>F: frame_tick
    B->>B: move paddles (buttons, clamp to screen)
    B->>B: move ball, bounce top/bottom, paddle hit
    alt ball passed a paddle
        B->>F: miss_left / miss_right
        F->>F: Game-reset: score_l or score_r +1, ball count +1
        F->>B: Game-init (ball to centre)
    end
    B-->>R: ball_x/y, paddle_l/r_y
    F-->>R: state, score_l, score_r
    Note over S,R: next visible area shows the new frame
